{
  "_comment": [
    "staged-flight.json's rocket with custom expressions, calculated by pristine upstream's own classes and by ours.",
    "Ours is patched (PATCH(expression-cache)): it keeps the built expression and the series between steps.",
    "Every form is here: plain variables, an expression using an earlier one, an indexed value, whole and partial ranges,",
    "and every function. random() is left out, since it takes no seed. CL, whose lclip upstream applies after the + that",
    "follows it, is here because ours must do the same.",
    "It stops at 2.9 s, before the sustainer lights: later the two engines choose different step lengths, and every mean would move with them."
  ],
